Presence of this file opts the project into the protoblast plugin's checkLiteralColors
compile gate (a literal color -- a hex, rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and their siblings, or a
named color -- in the declaration values of authored .scss, .css and .hwk styles is decided
outside the design tokens, so no theme, color scheme or brand ever reaches it; see
CheckLiteralColorsTask). No comment excuses a literal.

This file declares no token source: no custom-property or Sass-variable definition in this
project holds a literal color. A line opening with the token-source key, a colon and a glob
relative to this directory would declare one; until then such a definition is reported.
